  "details": "I can't believe this doesn't work. That's ridiculous.\n\nWhat do you mean I can't put filters on my video player? How can I make it sound like a radio or get muffled by walls, then?\n\nI had this whole gimmick planned for the clock radio, and not to mention basic wall occlusion.\n\nthis makes my house planning so much more difficult. I'm greatly hurt by the limitation of point sources with no occlusion, and I've been resorting to using trigger zones to activate filters.\n\nProTV controls BOTH \"Mute\" and \"Volume\" so I can't use either? A low pass filter was my best bet for that room to have fake occlusion, but I guess I just can't do it.",
